Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.10,0:01:27.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}On and on the Great River rolls, racing east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.30,0:01:36.50,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k61}Làng{\k69}huā {\k117}táo{\k107}jǐn {\k105}yīng{\k464}xióng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.30,0:01:36.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Of proud and gallant heroes its white-waves leave no trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.54,0:01:45.62,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k67}Shì{\k111}fēi {\k76}chéng{\k104}bài {\k129}zhuǎn{\k242}tóu{\k195}kōng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.54,0:01:45.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}As right and wrong, glory and fall,\N fade at once into nothingl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:50.02,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k69}Qīng{\k63}shān {\k40}yī{\k80}jiù {\k175}zài
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:50.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yet ever the green hills stay,
