Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:11.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}White-haired fishers and woodsmen comb on the river isles,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:19.38,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k50}Guàn{\k46}kàn {\k102}qiū{\k103}yuè {\k166}chūn{\k313}fēng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:19.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}looking on the autumn moons and spring breezes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:27.94,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k74}Yī{\k124}hú {\k120}zhuó{\k114}jiǔ {\k64}xǐ{\k167}xiāng{\k177}féng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:27.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With a jar of wine, they merrily gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:30.90,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k38}Gǔ{\k64}jīn {\k48}duō{\k70}shǎo {\k60}shì
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:30.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The countless tales of present and past,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.90,0:02:41.74,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k56}Duō{\k68}fù {\k518}xiào {\k127}tán {\k316}zhōng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.90,0:02:41.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}all in their jests.
