Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.40,0:03:14.42,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,900,3350,3900)\pos(640,348)}Act 4
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.40,0:03:14.42,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,900,3350,3900)\pos(640,551.733)}Three Divided Unite as One
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:22.66,Episode Title,,0,0,0,0,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1000,5660,6540)\pos(653.755,425.554)}Episode 78 \N\N\N\NFeigning Illness to Fool Cao Shuang
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.14,0:03:26.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the third year of the Jingchu era, early 239 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:28.98,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,the lord of Wei, Cao Rui, fell grievously ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:32.38,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He took the advice of\N Palace Attendants Liu Fang and Sun Zi,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.38,0:03:36.34,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,appointing Cao Shuang as Great General and giving him control over the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.34,0:03:40.34,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,When his illness worsened, he swiftly recalled Grand Commandant Sima Yi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:43.14,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,and appointed him as regent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.14,0:03:45.54,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Your subject, Sima Yi, greets Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:51.58,Default,Cao Rui,0,0,0,,I feared we would not meet again, but now\N that I have seen you, I can die in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.58,0:03:55.70,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,To have seen you today is \Nthis subject's greatest fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.18,0:04:17.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,22980,3300)\pos(413.04,504.423)}Cáo Fāng\NStyled: Lánqīng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:23.26,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, the Great General, \NCao Shuang, wishes to converse with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:22.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4700,4700)\pos(311.542,446.654)}Cáo Shuǎng\NStyled: Zhāobó
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:22.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4700,4700)\pos(776.74,494.56)}Zhāng Dāng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.26,0:04:25.14,Default,Cáo Fāng,0,0,0,,Beloved liegeman, please speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:26.94,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.94,0:04:31.30,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,{\bord11}As fall becomes winter, this is the time to honor our ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:35.22,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,{\bord11}We desire to invite you to visit \NGaoping Mausoleum tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.22,0:04:38.22,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,{\bord11}We would be offering sacrifices to the departed Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:40.70,Default,Cáo Fāng,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}Will it be a hunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.70,0:04:43.78,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}The Great General has arranged for it beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:45.90,Default,Cáo Fāng,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}Heed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.90,0:04:47.34,Default,Cáo Fāng,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}We shall visit the Mausoleum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:51.14,Default,Cáo Fāng,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Sacrifices will be made to the departed lord.\NThe officials shall attend as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:52.90,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,We shall obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.78,0:05:13.02,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}Father, His Majesty gave an edict.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.02,0:05:15.94,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord11}He will visit Gaoping Mausoleum \Nto offer sacrifices to the late Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.94,0:05:19.06,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Cao Shuang and the court officials shall accompany him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.06,0:05:20.58,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Their departure is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.90,0:05:27.54,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,I, Zhang Dang, greet you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.22,0:05:33.58,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Please rise, please rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.38,0:05:36.90,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,The many states have sent tributes to the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.90,0:05:39.54,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,All of it shall first go to this mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.46,0:06:13.86,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}Bronze mirrors with designs are commonplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.86,0:06:16.58,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}Send them away to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:20.54,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,{\bord11}This mirror is unique \Nwith its Zhou-era inscription.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:23.46,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,{\bord11}"The 'azure canopy' created this at the submission of all barbarians;"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:27.26,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,{\bord11}"many felicitations to the people of the middle-kingdom for their fortune."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:32.58,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,The words "people of the middle-kingdom" are indeed unique!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:37.98,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,You and the treasure-deliverers shall keep them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.98,0:06:38.46,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:06:57.26,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,What is happening in the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.26,0:06:59.98,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,His Majesty awaits to go hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.34,0:07:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The Minister of Finance, Huan Fan, and the Overseer of Jing Province, Li Sheng, request an audience!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.54,0:07:08.38,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Invite them in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:30.74,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Now you are becoming Overseer of Jing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:34.02,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Treat everything as important and keep up with court affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.66,0:07:41.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2980,3340)\pos(339.736,512.877)}Lǐ Shèng\NStyled: Gōngzhāo
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.30,0:07:41.74,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,Minister of Finance, Master Huan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:48.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,6180,6580)\pos(291.806,450.881)}Huán Fàn\NStyled: Yuánzé
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.98,0:07:45.94,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Overseer Li.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:51.66,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,This promotion is certainly cause for celebration!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:56.26,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,This is all due to the support of the General!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.46,0:08:03.30,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,How pitiful! How detestable!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.62,0:08:18.58,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}"The birds are in the southern mountains."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:23.50,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}"Yet, nets are set up in the northern mountains."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:35.78,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}"With the birds soaring high, what can the nets do?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:40.46,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.46,0:08:45.06,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,Sir, are you suggesting that I am going to \NJing Province to escape some danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.46,0:08:53.90,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Overseer Li.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:58.30,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,You have good insight \Nand are both flexible and pragmatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:09:00.70,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,You can slip away quite quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:08.86,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,He is just drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:10.54,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Me, drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:12.18,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.74,0:09:17.02,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Great General, you feast and drink every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.02,0:09:22.58,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,You are in an intoxicated slumber, \Nignorant to the coming calamity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:25.42,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Your drunken ramblings are nonsensical!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.42,0:09:29.34,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,General, if you do not believe me, you can ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.34,0:09:30.94,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.94,0:09:32.54,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.54,0:09:36.30,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,You once said that the Great General \Nonly knew how to leave the city to hunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:39.34,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,oblivious that three fierce tigers\N lurk within the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:40.86,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,Sima Yi and his sons!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:44.54,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,This same prattle again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:48.22,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Ridiculous, \N fearing as if the heavens could fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:52.54,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}Do remember that the Martial Emperor once said,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:54.66,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}"Sima Yi is calculating and ruthless."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.66,0:09:56.50,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}"Do not let him lead an army."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:09:59.86,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}"If you do, the nation will fall before long."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:05.98,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,It has been ten years since I banned him from having any military authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:11.74,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,With the Sima family secluded in \Ntheir estate, they will not do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:14.90,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,With the elder unable to get up from a terminal illness,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:17.34,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,there is only the two young lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.34,0:10:19.74,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,What is there to fear from them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.74,0:10:26.30,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Only Heaven knows if he is ill \Nor if he is just putting on an act.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.66,0:10:35.26,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Overseer Li, you might as well bid the old man farewell when you are heading to your post.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.26,0:10:37.02,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Ascertain his condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:38.54,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:53.62,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Father, Li Sheng has been appointed Overseer of Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.62,0:10:55.18,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,He has come to bid you farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.94,0:11:02.38,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,That farewell is just an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:05.78,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Cao Shuang has sent him here to investigate my illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:08.26,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:19.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(327.048,446.654)}Sīmǎ Zhāo\NStyled: Zǐshàng
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:25.46,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Set it by the documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:35.54,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.54,0:11:37.86,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Invite him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.50,0:11:39.54,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.82,0:11:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.46,0:12:05.70,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,Many days have passed since I last saw you, sir,\Nso I wanted to pay you a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.62,0:12:21.10,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,My father has trouble getting up. Apologies for the incontinence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.74,0:12:28.30,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,I never thought the Grand Tutor would be this seriously ill!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:35.70,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.70,0:12:39.14,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,The Son of Heaven has appointed me Overseer of Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.14,0:12:42.18,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,I have come to visit you before I depart for my post.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.54,0:12:49.54,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Bing Province is crucial to defend the North...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:54.90,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,You must always... be vigilant...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.90,0:12:57.74,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,I am heading to Jing Province, not Bing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.82,0:13:08.62,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,You are...not heading to Bing Province, you are coming from it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.38,0:13:14.06,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,No, I mean Jing Province in the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.50,0:13:24.62,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,So you are coming from Jing Province...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.22,0:13:29.78,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,How did his illness develop?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.38,0:13:33.18,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,It started with him losing his hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:35.10,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,May I have pen and paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.70,0:13:57.70,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,I cannot hear well. It was good to interrupt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.06,0:14:07.90,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,When you leave to Jing Province, you must take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:30.30,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,With old age and illness affecting me, my death is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:37.54,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,My two sons are incompetent dogs. I hope you can teach them well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:45.58,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,If you meet with the Great General,\N then on my behalf, you must ask him...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:53.22,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Ask him... to look after my sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.22,0:14:56.62,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,I... I could then die at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.26,0:15:09.58,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,Take care, Grand Tutor. I shall take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:44.98,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,That went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.30,0:15:49.62,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,If he reports back with what he witnessed,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:51.74,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Cao Shuang will lose all suspicion of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:57.26,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,We only need to wait for him to exit the city for his hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:09.54,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,The elderly Sima is that ill!\NWhat a pity, what a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.54,0:16:15.94,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,When trying to drink soup, he lost control \Nand made a mess all over himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.38,0:16:21.58,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Sima Yi has extraordinary cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:24.98,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Beware of his tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:29.50,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,All of his hair was white and he struggled to get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:31.62,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,His death is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.62,0:16:33.70,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,What sort of scheme could do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:42.62,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Ten years have passed so fast. \NHe is already over seventy years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:50.02,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,I saw old age and illness\N affecting him. His death is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:55.06,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,He also asked you, Great General, to look after his two sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.06,0:16:59.10,Default,Lǐ Shèng,0,0,0,,He said that if you fulfill that favor, he can die in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:10.22,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,He has already arranged \Nposthumous matters. What a pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:17.90,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,With that man dead,\NI will have no more worries!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.74,0:17:32.26,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Great General, Great General!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:37.90,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,You three brothers should not leave with the imperial army.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.90,0:17:41.10,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,If something unexpected happens in the city, what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.94,0:17:44.74,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Who would dare rebel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.74,0:17:48.58,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,You worry about nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, what he said is certainly correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.02,0:17:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not have your brothers guard the mansion for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.06,0:17:58.74,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,You are a cowardly mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:01.82,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:06.14,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Great General,\Nguard against problems before they occur!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.38,0:18:08.62,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Clear the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.82,0:18:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Our respects, Grand Tutor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.54,0:19:03.18,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Minister over the Masses Gao?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:04.54,Default,Gāo Róu,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.74,0:19:09.30,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,You shall be given an axe tally\Npermitting you to act as Great General.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.30,0:19:12.18,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,You are to take over Cao Shuang's camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.82,0:19:14.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(321.41,466.38)}Gāo Róu\NStyled: Wénhuì
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.18,0:19:12.86,Default,Gāo Róu,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.78,0:19:16.06,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Minister Coachman Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.06,0:19:17.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(297.445,470.607)}Wáng Guān
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.70,0:19:17.22,Default,Wáng Guān,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.82,0:19:23.14,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,You are to act as General of the Center. Go occupy the western camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.14,0:19:24.66,Default,Wáng Guān,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:28.82,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,As for the rest of you, \Nfollow me to the rear palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:36.58,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,We shall petition Empress Dowager there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.58,0:19:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.94,0:19:41.26,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Hurry, take over the arsenals!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.26,0:19:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.78,0:19:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.30,0:19:48.22,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Exit the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.14,0:20:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi is causing a scene. What shall we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.54,0:20:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge out of the city and meet the Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:36.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(336.916,464.971)}Sī Fán
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.42,0:20:34.82,Default,Sī Fán,0,0,0,,Go report to the Grand Tutor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.82,0:20:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.42,0:20:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant Xin Chang and Marshal Lu Zhi's troops charged out Pingchang Gate to Gaoping Mausoleum.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.78,0:20:46.30,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Has Huan Fan escaped?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.30,0:20:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We have not seen Huan Fan leave the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.34,0:20:51.18,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.70,0:20:57.10,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Summon Huan Fan here so I may consult him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.10,0:20:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.38,0:20:59.62,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.34,0:21:05.22,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Take many soldiers and make certain Huan Fan cannot escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.22,0:21:11.34,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Order Si Fan, who guards the city gates, to monitor Pingchang Gate more closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.34,0:21:14.50,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Without authorization, \Nnone can leave the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.42,0:21:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, the imperial retinue is at Gaoping.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.74,0:21:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be risky to leave the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.30,0:21:37.50,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,The Grand Marshal's seal is with me. \NWe have our own means of exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, hurry. Go through the back gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.62,0:21:44.22,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.94,0:21:48.86,Default,Sī Fán,0,0,0,,Stop, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.74,0:21:51.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(348.194,457.926)}Sī Fán
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.62,0:21:54.58,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,The Empress Dowager gave an edict!\NOpen the gates now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:58.38,Default,Sī Fán,0,0,0,,Please show the edict! After you prove it, we will let you through!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.26,0:22:03.50,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Si Fan, you were my subordinate for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.50,0:22:06.30,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Do you still not recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.30,0:22:08.58,Default,Sī Fán,0,0,0,,You were my benefactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.58,0:22:11.14,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,If you're worried, come inspect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:14.22,Default,Sī Fán,0,0,0,,I dare not! Open the gates, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.62,0:22:29.82,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Si Fan, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.82,0:22:32.78,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,The Grand Tutor is rebelling in the city! Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.42,0:22:35.46,Default,Sī Fán,0,0,0,,My benefactor, are you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.46,0:22:41.70,Default,Sī Fán,0,0,0,,Give chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.66,0:22:43.98,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,They did not catch him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.06,0:22:50.78,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,The Bag of Wisdom has eluded me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.90,0:22:54.30,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,What to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.26,0:22:57.62,Default,Jiǎng Jì,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor, do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:22:57.62,Default,Jiǎng Jì,0,0,0,,As the saying goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:23:00.34,Default,Jiǎng Jì,0,0,0,,"An inferior horse wants only fodder."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.34,0:23:04.82,Default,Jiǎng Jì,0,0,0,,Cao Shuang only desires the pretty women of his mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.06,0:23:08.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4780,5220)\pos(456.74,472.016)}Jiǎng Jì\NStyled: Zǐtōng
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.82,0:23:10.46,Default,Jiǎng Jì,0,0,0,,Even if Huan Fan, that Bag of Wisdom, offers strategies, he will not listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.58,0:23:14.78,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Xu Yun, Chen Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.78,0:23:16.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(280.529,494.56)}Xǔ Yún
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.78,0:23:16.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(969.868,483.288)}Chén Tài
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.02,0:23:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Present!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.26,0:23:21.50,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Go to Cao Shuang and tell him I have no ulterior motives,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.50,0:23:24.66,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,that I am only relieving them of military authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.66,0:23:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.82,0:23:30.42,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Summon the Lieutenant-Colonel of the Halls, Yin Damu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.42,0:23:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.38,0:23:36.34,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Zitong, craft a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.82,0:23:41.26,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,One that encourages Cao Shuang to return to Luoyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.26,0:23:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.70,0:23:47.50,Default,Yin Damu,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.38,0:23:52.98,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Colonel Yin, you are close friends with Cao Shuang.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.98,0:23:56.94,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Deliver this message to Gaoping Mausoleum as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.94,0:24:01.98,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Say that I and Grand Commandant Jiang have sworn an oath by the Luo River.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.98,0:24:06.86,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,My actions today are only against military authority, with no ulterior motives.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.90,0:24:10.98,Default,Yin Damu,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.66,0:24:17.50,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,Great General!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.90,0:24:21.94,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,Sir, there is a rebellion in the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.94,0:24:24.38,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,The Grand Tutor has sent a petiton!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.38,0:24:25.58,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,A petition?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.38,0:24:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Now Great General Cao Shuang\Nhas betrayed the orders of the late Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.34,0:24:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}thrown state law into chaos, overstepped his power, and monopolized authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.58,0:24:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}He appointed Zhang Dang as Director-in-Chief, colluding with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.82,0:24:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}He has spied on the Emperor and coveted the imperial regalia,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.66,0:24:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11)}sowing discord between the two palaces and harming blood relations.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.34,0:24:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11)}The realm is in great turmoil and the people are anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.38,0:24:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11)}I petitioned to \NEmpress Dowager of Yongning Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.66,0:24:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}I have ordered the officials to relieve \NCao Shuang, Cao Xi, and Cao Xun of troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.22,0:24:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11)}They are to return to their residences as Marquises and not linger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.86,0:25:00.22,Default,Cáo Fāng,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}The Grand Tutor will revoke your military power.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.22,0:25:02.22,Default,Cáo Fāng,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}How will you deal with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.74,0:25:05.70,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.42,0:25:15.74,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,This is a matter of life or death, make a decision now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.98,0:25:22.54,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,How do I deal with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.54,0:25:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Older brother, you ignored advice,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.62,0:25:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and now we have brought this disaster upon ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.54,0:25:35.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4180,4540)\pos(827.489,477.652)}Cáo Xī
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.98,0:25:29.98,Default,Cáo Xī,0,0,0,,Sima Yi's cunning is peerless!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.98,0:25:34.82,Default,Cáo Xī,0,0,0,,If even Zhuge Liang could not beat him, then what of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.10,0:25:41.10,Default,Cáo Xī,0,0,0,,Better to bind ourselves, apologize for our crimes to him, and ask for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.86,0:25:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.82,0:25:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, the defense of the city \Nis as strong as an iron barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.94,0:25:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Grand Tutor put troops on the Luo River bridges.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.42,0:26:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,With the city already hard to besiege,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.18,0:26:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,you should settle on a strategy soon, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.58,0:26:06.50,Default,Cáo Xī,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.50,0:26:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.06,0:26:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Great General!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.34,0:26:16.46,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Bag of Wisdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.46,0:26:21.90,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Bag of Wisdom, what can you teach me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.02,0:26:25.78,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,The Grand Tutor has already rebelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.78,0:26:31.26,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,General, why not have the\N imperial procession move to Xudu?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.26,0:26:34.50,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,You can then gather troops in other areas to suppress Sima Yi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.22,0:26:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What a great plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.26,0:26:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Only by going through with it\Ncan we save our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.06,0:26:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Minister speaks true!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.98,0:26:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.94,0:26:53.26,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,My wife, children, and wealth are all in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.62,0:26:57.78,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,How could I abandon them and not be anxious?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.34,0:27:02.30,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Even a fool still seeks to survive when in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.66,0:27:07.58,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,You and the Emperor can command the realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.58,0:27:09.58,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Who would dare ignore you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.58,0:27:13.74,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,How could you trap yourself by returning to the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.46,0:27:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to Xudu.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.94,0:27:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us your military orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.86,0:27:20.74,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Xudu has ample food supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.74,0:27:23.50,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,The journey there will take half a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.50,0:27:26.22,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,I have carried the seal of the Grand Marshal with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.78,0:27:30.78,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Great General, you must act now and mobilize troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.30,0:27:38.66,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,You all do not have to pressure me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.46,0:27:43.66,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Wait for me to ponder on this carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.34,0:27:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Great General!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.22,0:28:06.06,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Did you two come from the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.06,0:28:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Great General.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.14,0:28:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The Grand Tutor sent us to explain matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.26,0:28:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Today he acted only against military power, with no ulterior motives.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.58,0:28:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He has said many times that he is only acting against your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.98,0:28:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, return to the city now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.54,0:28:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Great General!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.30,0:28:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Great General!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.34,0:28:26.58,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Yin Damu!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.78,0:28:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Great General!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.26,0:28:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Great General!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.58,0:28:33.22,Default,Yin Damu,0,0,0,,The Grand Tutor and Commandant Jiang made an oath at the Luo River.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.22,0:28:36.30,Default,Yin Damu,0,0,0,,Should you give up your military power, you can soon return home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.30,0:28:38.02,Default,Yin Damu,0,0,0,,Here, a letter from Commandant Jiang.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.02,0:28:42.22,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,This is an emergency; do not listen to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.22,0:28:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, let us return!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.70,0:28:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, do not! Do not!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.18,0:28:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a decision and order an attack on Sima Yi!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.74,0:28:48.46,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,-Do not pressure me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.50,0:28:55.70,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Let me consider this in my own time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.94,0:29:10.38,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Father, I wish to march a force of three thousand on Gaoping Mausoleum tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.14,0:29:16.62,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Father, take preemptive action lest unfavorable developments occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.30,0:29:21.02,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}Master Sun said,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.02,0:29:26.90,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11}"To only subdue and not fight the soldiers of others is the best strategy."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.90,0:29:28.22,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}However,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.22,0:29:31.82,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord11}though it is excellent to\N subdue foes without using the blade,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.82,0:29:37.14,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord11}I fear that the Bag of Wisdom \Nwould not willingly stand down his troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.90,0:29:40.70,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}I do pity him for choosing the wrong master.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.70,0:29:45.38,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11}All Cao Shuang thinks about are the beautiful concubines in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.38,0:29:51.22,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Even if the Bag of Wisdom offers wise plans, they will not be used.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.82,0:29:57.06,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}Cao Shuang will not sleep well tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.86,0:30:12.06,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,It is hard to enjoy drinking alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.82,0:30:19.74,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,My entire family is in Luoyang...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.98,0:30:28.38,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,How could they survive \Namidst such a large-scale rebellion?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.46,0:31:02.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 100)}"Let there be peace across the land; \Nbring order everywhere."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.50,0:31:11.26,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11}"Let there be peace across the land, \Nbring order everywhere."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.94,0:31:15.86,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}If we unite the lands into one,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.86,0:31:18.78,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}we will be renowned as the heroes of our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.58,0:31:26.14,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Wei, Shu, and Wu divide the world in three.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.98,0:31:30.98,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Liu Bei was just a mat-weaver and shoe-seller,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.98,0:31:35.66,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,yet he was able to secure one corner of the land and attain a hegemony of his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.62,0:31:43.34,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,The way he did it can be summed up in four words.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.06,0:31:50.42,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Winning over people's hearts?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.82,0:31:52.78,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Commanding the common folk?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.50,0:31:57.14,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}The ancients said,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.14,0:32:00.98,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11}"He who has the hearts of the people can become the Emperor."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.14,0:32:06.66,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11}"He who has the heart of the Emperor can become a lord."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.66,0:32:10.70,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11}"He who has the heart of a lord can become a grandee."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.70,0:32:18.50,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11}How would you two win over the hearts of the people?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.50,0:32:22.46,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord11}The hearts of those in the \NCentral Plains can be won over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.46,0:32:29.26,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord11}We can certainly make the people of the three kingdoms act in our interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.94,0:32:35.02,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11}If that is so, then the thousands of miles of rivers and mountains
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.02,0:32:37.74,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}will be controlled by the Sima clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.34,0:32:40.34,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}Remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.06,0:32:49.66,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Winning over the hearts of the people will unite the world under one banner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.62,0:32:54.78,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.78,0:32:59.14,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,After spending all night thinking, why have you still been unable to make a decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.06,0:33:11.42,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}I cannot muster troops...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.10,0:33:17.18,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}and I want to leave my post.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.58,0:33:25.22,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}I would be content to remain a wealthy family head.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.10,0:33:32.10,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}How can you still sleep \Nwhile next to a tiger or a wolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.30,0:33:42.70,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Bag of Wisdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.14,0:33:54.62,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Zidan!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.38,0:34:00.90,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Cao Zhen!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.38,0:34:06.42,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,You were a leading hero of your generation!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.06,0:34:10.30,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Your wisdom and plans were extraordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.94,0:34:14.42,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Why, then, did you beget those three boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.42,0:34:17.86,Default,Huán Fàn,0,0,0,,Stupid as pigs and dull as cattle!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.94,0:34:26.46,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Here is the seal of the Grand Marshal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.46,0:34:30.78,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,I shall task you two with delivering it to the Grand Tutor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.74,0:34:37.22,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,You two, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.22,0:34:39.78,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Give it to the Grand Tutor when you see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.34,0:34:44.34,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,You must not let it fall in the hands of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.34,0:34:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.78,0:34:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, if you hand over\N military power, our lives will be in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.66,0:34:56.58,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,The Grand Tutor would never break his promise to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.10,0:35:10.10,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, do not leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.34,0:35:15.70,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, do not leave! Do not leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.86,0:35:22.62,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Fine... Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.34,0:35:57.50,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 660)}Detain Zhang Dang.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.50,0:35:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.06,0:36:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.78,0:36:43.02,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Are you not the Minister of Finance?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.22,0:36:49.30,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Bag of Wisdom, why do you look so unhappy?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.98,0:37:10.02,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,It must be due to his master.\NWhat a pity, what a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.18,0:37:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.22,0:37:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.34,0:37:19.06,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Get eight hundred soldiers and \Nsurround the mansion of the Great General.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.86,0:37:25.26,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,I am innocent! I am innocent! I am innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.26,0:37:25.90,Default,Minister of Justice,0,0,0,,Zhang Dang!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.82,0:37:32.22,Default,Minister of Justice,0,0,0,,You and Cao Shuang schemed\N together, just waiting to rebel!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.22,0:37:33.74,Default,Minister of Justice,0,0,0,,Do you still not confess?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.74,0:37:37.02,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor, Grand Tutor, spare me, spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.02,0:37:40.30,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,Even if I had the gall, I would not dare rebel!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.30,0:37:47.94,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor, show mercy, show mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.94,0:37:49.66,Default,Minister of Justice,0,0,0,,Take him out, beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.66,0:37:57.30,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor, Grand Tutor, spare me, spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.02,0:38:07.26,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.10,0:38:12.42,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Cao Shuang has sent a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.42,0:38:16.78,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,He says that he has run out of food, \Nand thus asks to borrow some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.06,0:38:23.34,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Lend him a hundred {\i1}hu{\i0} of grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.06,0:38:26.38,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,How can a Great General starve to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.38,0:38:27.78,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.06,0:38:30.86,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Wait until we get the truth about the rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.86,0:38:35.06,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,We shall then petition the court \Nand have the Emperor make the decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.06,0:38:42.02,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,I wish to confess! I wish to confess!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.82,0:38:36.62,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.02,0:38:43.26,Default,Minister of Justice,0,0,0,,Bring him before us!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.58,0:38:48.58,Default,Minister of Justice,0,0,0,,Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.22,0:38:51.38,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,I confess that...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.22,0:38:55.66,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,I and Cao Shuang plotted to rebel...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.94,0:38:58.46,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,To rebel...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.42,0:39:00.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(339.736,493.425)}Minister of Justice
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.34,0:39:00.70,Default,Minister of Justice,0,0,0,,When is the rebellion?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.66,0:39:04.58,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,In the third... third month...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.58,0:39:07.34,Default,Minister of Justice,0,0,0,,Who else was in the plot? Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.34,0:39:10.34,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,Besides the three Cao brothers and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.34,0:39:20.42,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,there was also He Yan, Deng Yang, Li Sheng, Bi Gui, and Ding Mi.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.06,0:39:29.78,Default,Minister of Justice,0,0,0,,Stamp your hand as an affidavit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.90,0:39:39.10,Default,Zhāng Dāng,0,0,0,,I will, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.54,0:39:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.82,0:40:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He Yan, Deng Yang, Li Sheng, Bi Gui, and Ding Mi have signed confessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.06,0:40:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They have indeed plotted to rebel with Cao Shuang.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.62,0:40:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huan Fan claimed to carry Empress Dowager's edict so as to leave the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.82,0:40:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He claimed that you plotted a rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.42,0:40:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He should be held accountable.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.46,0:40:22.74,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,He should be punished for slandering people of scheming.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.74,0:40:27.46,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Imprison him first, then await my petition to the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.46,0:40:29.34,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,He shall share the punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.22,0:40:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We also have to deal with \NCao Shuang's subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.10,0:40:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Xin Chang and Lu Zhi occupied the city gates \Nand Yang Zong did not want to return the seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.30,0:40:49.34,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,They were each fulfilling their duties and working for their master.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.34,0:40:56.70,Default,Sima Yi,0,0,0,,Announce that Cao Shuang's associates will not be investigated and will be reinstated to their ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.70,0:41:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You are very benevolent and just.\NYou will have the support of the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.26,0:41:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor, Grand Tutor!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.46,0:41:21.22,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Lord Sima truly has no intention of harming me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.94,0:41:26.50,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Today, I can even enjoy tasty hot soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.74,0:41:30.66,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,I am content.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.06,0:41:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.74,0:41:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.38,0:41:53.66,Default,Yin Damu,0,0,0,,Hear the imperial edict!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.66,0:41:56.82,Default,Yin Damu,0,0,0,,The rebellious Cao brothers \Nhave coveted the imperial regalia.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.82,0:41:59.10,Default,Yin Damu,0,0,0,,By law, they and their kin shall be slain.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.62,0:42:08.70,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor, why have you broken your promise to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.70,0:42:09.50,Default,Yin Damu,0,0,0,,Take them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.86,0:42:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.74,0:42:18.18,Default,Cáo Xī,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.18,0:42:21.78,Default,Cao Shuang,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor, why have you \Nbroken your promise to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.98,0:42:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.54,0:42:49.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640, 180)}"Let there be peace across the land; bring order everywhere."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.90,0:42:59.54,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the third year of the \NJiaping era, July 251 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.54,0:43:02.38,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sima Yi died from an illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.54,0:43:07.50,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,His son, Sima Shi, was appointed as Great General.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.50,0:43:11.50,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He presided over the Secretariat and handled major matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.50,0:43:14.98,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sima Zhao was made Great General of Fast Cavalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.02,0:43:21.30,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Thus, the politics of the Wei came to be overseen by the Sima clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.72,0:43:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(658.166,674.843)}{\bord12.706}The blade's light and sword's shadow fade,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.56,0:43:53.16,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k52}Àn{\k44}dàn{\k60}liao {\k77}dāo{\k64}guāng{\k146}jiàn{\k117}yǐng
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.84,0:43:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(658.166,674.843)}{\bord12.706}Far away is the drum and horn's serenade;
